{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id614829560"}, "name":{"label":"DC Blythe"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-10-31T22:28:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"1889100058"}, "title":{"label":"Brilliant app, even the free version"}, "content":{"label":"Unbelievable how many features Bear offers for the free version. The only one I missed - therefore bought the Pro - was the cross device feature. Now I can quickly sketch my ideas on my iPhone and then continue writing on my Mac without transferring anything from one device to the other. \nIt’s a very simple app to use, extremely powerful at the same time.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id24705979"}, "name":{"label":"P.J.E"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-10-22T12:43:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"1867479920"}, "title":{"label":"Brilliant"}, "content":{"label":"After many years using plain text for notes, I am now a Bear convert. Markdown support and ability to export notes as Textbundle are both essential aspects of this app for me. Great integration with Workflow App and lovey UI. The best notes app there is. Well worth the subscription and it is reassuring that the developers have pricing model that will help this app stay around a very long time. Thanks Shiny Frog!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id37848477"}, "name":{"label":"Kakubei"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-10-15T03:02:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"1850238877"}, "title":{"label":"Best writing app for iOS"}, "content":{"label":"I love Bear. Beautiful interface, great features. I stopped using Ulysses thanks to Bear. Yes, there is room for improvement but the developers are very proactive and responsive. \n\nPay for the pro versions so you can sync seamlessly across Mac and iOS. Money well spent.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id537143357"}, "name":{"label":"glric"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-10-14T06:19:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"1848311040"}, "title":{"label":"Best note taking and writing App"}, "content":{"label":"A simple, clear, and friendly App for you to take notes and write your ideas. Love this App.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id130486267"}, "name":{"label":"SimonbLondon"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-10-11T13:40:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3"}, "id":{"label":"1842319392"}, "title":{"label":"Really want to love the Bear but.."}, "content":{"label":"Has become irritating not having Autocomplete for Tags. Whilst the tag system's potentially a great way to organise notes, having to search or type correctly each time is too slow. Make a mistake and that's a new tag, arggh!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id247910683"}, "name":{"label":"Mees-Place"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-10-07T09:10:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.5"}, "id":{"label":"1833287070"}, "title":{"label":"Love This App - Perfect"}, "content":{"label":"Have this installed on iPhone, iPad and a couple of notebooks.   The best note taking app so far.   Uncluttered yet rich (hashtags are a superb idea), seamless sync combined with ease of export make it perfect.   Job well done!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id554531530"}, "name":{"label":"Col.Skor"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-10-06T04:58:42-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.5"}, "id":{"label":"1830704843"}, "title":{"label":"5 Stars!"}, "content":{"label":"So cute and useful", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id249240604"}, "name":{"label":"Mr Sea Jay"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-10-01T02:15:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.5"}, "id":{"label":"1820378502"}, "title":{"label":"Perfect."}, "content":{"label":"No fluff or extra menus, but still inherently powerful. Evernote was my workspace for years, but it now seems clunky and frankly irritating to navigate. \n\nI never understood why people use hashtags, except maybe for PR. But then I thought - why create folders, why endlessly have to navigate and move notes around. And what if I’m writing about a subject that should be in two places? Say - ‘outstanding work’ as well as ‘character sketches’. And if the feeling hits me, I don’t want to start navigating, I just want to open a fresh page and write. Bear allows this. I write what I like, put a hashtag at the end, and that either groups it together in the side menus with all notes sharing that hashtag, or if the hashtag is new it creates a new menu to add to later. It’s as simple and intuitive as I could ever want.\n\nTHANK YOU TEAM BEAR.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"6"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id30038503"}, "name":{"label":"Why do I have give nickname?"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-09-26T06:47:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.5"}, "id":{"label":"1811025007"}, "title":{"label":"What’s not to like?"}, "content":{"label":"Over many years I have tried various solutions to organise my information, Bear is the simplest, cleanest, neatest and (so far) reliable solution I have used. Effortless synch between Mac and iPad (through my own iCloud space, so no additional Cloud servers involved). A real and welcome find.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id266926068"}, "name":{"label":"atomikbr"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-09-10T12:12:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.4"}, "id":{"label":"1783972685"}, "title":{"label":"Great app"}, "content":{"label":"Beats apple notes hands down", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id247022636"}, "name":{"label":"nick5535"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-09-09T04:12:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.4"}, "id":{"label":"1781813869"}, "title":{"label":"Simple, responsive, elegant"}, "content":{"label":"Love how simple and directly accessible Bear is, I don't have to go trawling through a bunch of side menus and dialogues to attach a picture or reflate two notes, it just works. \n\nWould love to see the ability to un/lock the app with touchID to make it as secure as it can be.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id356750157"}, "name":{"label":"A Cat named Dog"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-09-08T13:53:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.4"}, "id":{"label":"1780804211"}, "title":{"label":"Missing one feature"}, "content":{"label":"This is a fantastic and stylish app that I would truly recommend...but, in order to replace my use of word, it would need the option to use tables. Please add this feature!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id301786203"}, "name":{"label":"HarrisGlobe"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-08-28T01:15:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.4"}, "id":{"label":"1756154931"}, "title":{"label":"Bourgeoning with features"}, "content":{"label":"To be succinct this app is exceptional. It is awfully good for note-taking and the markdown features are remarkable. \n\nA note to the editors: Please commit to keeping the core features free forever.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
