{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id495029660"}, "name":{"label":"TeddyTraining"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-08-21T06:11:46-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.4"}, "id":{"label":"1737168943"}, "title":{"label":"Simply best App"}, "content":{"label":"This App is the most organised App I've seen - easy to use and efficient.\nYou just have to copy your notes one by one and it doesn't recognise photos when copy and paste but all in all 10 out of 10", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id41977987"}, "name":{"label":"Oso Azul"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-08-18T02:46:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.4"}, "id":{"label":"1732866481"}, "title":{"label":"Almost - but no honey for this Pooh."}, "content":{"label":"I am not a fan of subscription ware - particularly on relatively lightweight iOS apps.\n\nThe free version is actually very good - and I have used a lot of notes apps and this could have taken the number one slot.\n\nI only need the app about once or twice a month - so a subscription is overkill. \n\nIt isn't much money - and I understand the appeal for developers - but it is a repellent for me. I would even consider a PAYG option (like magic plan) which could be the same amount of money - but then I can recharge it to clients.\n\nSo great software stymied by the business model.\n\nSO I went with Inkflow Pro. Also a great app. Great enough to disqualify subscription to Bear. And their tech support is faultless.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id104849016"}, "name":{"label":"Van_Glorious"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-08-16T12:49:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"1730624286"}, "title":{"label":"Beautiful"}, "content":{"label":"It's a beautiful app, very clean and slick, the tags are innovative.  \n\nNeeds to be better at importing from other note apps.\n\nNeeds a web interface. \n\nOverall excellent.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id23053337"}, "name":{"label":"wristtattoo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-08-12T22:31:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.3"}, "id":{"label":"1725481363"}, "title":{"label":"Five star app"}, "content":{"label":"Bear is quite simply a joy to use and has to be the best note/markdown/production app out there. UIWebView or UITextView? Who cares? I haven’t found one to better it.\n\nMy only gripe was to have Browser support when i work remotely away from my desktop as i’ve never been a fast typer using Bear on iOS. Bear’s Support Developers replied to my query that Browser support is in the making and will be coming soon.\n\nSubscribe £1.49 a month for Bear Pro. It's a no-brainer!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
