{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id312572616"}, "name":{"label":"MisuKiti"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-09T15:51:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"1639029272"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing App!!"}, "content":{"label":"I fully recommend downloading this app! For someone who likes to be a perfectionist when it comes to their work this app is everything!! I love it, even for the simplest things of shopping lists - I get excited to write them down with a little check box and then ticking it ( you can even make little keys for important things and non-important ) It makes the boring stuff so much fun and I love it!! I'll admit I haven't delved deep enough to understand the entirety of this app but so far it's amazing and I love it!!! ^-^", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
