{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id42097179"}, "name":{"label":"emkay_online"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-02T09:01:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"1631552527"}, "title":{"label":"I seriously under estimated this app"}, "content":{"label":"I should have subscribed when this app came out, but I have only just dug deeper and realised its full potential.  I used to use a wiki for all my notes, but this does everything I need without having to fiddle with the technicalities of a wiki.  The hierarchical tags, the thumbnails in the file list, the advanced search options, and the [[linking between documents]]\n\nOnly a few features to go and this app with be amazing. \n\nps. Loving the cute stickers too", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id322540038"}, "name":{"label":"HeteronomousFB"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-01T10:27:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2"}, "id":{"label":"1630654002"}, "title":{"label":"Going in the wrong direction"}, "content":{"label":"Started out promising but has now abandoned the needs of serious writer and has aimed for the kids with toys and bells and whistles. It is impossible to take an iPad app seriously for writing if it does not have typewriter scrolling. Instead we get new cartoons. Cancelling my sub and going back to (paid for once) Ulysses 3 which is streets ahead.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
