{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id42360665"}, "name":{"label":"Cartroo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-16T00:57:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.2"}, "id":{"label":"1615181689"}, "title":{"label":"Utility, beauty and simplicity"}, "content":{"label":"I've been a long-time Evernote user, but always rather dissatisfied with the inconsistency across platforms. As soon as I started using Bear I knew my Evernote days were numbered; once they added multiple levels of tags, its fate was sealed. I love being able to use familiar Markdown syntax, but with the convenience of WYSIWYG editing, and the tagging and search features are great. There are also great touches like being able to drag bullets to change their order. Overall a very polished product, long may it continue!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=1016366447&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
